   "type": "heading",
   "text": "WHAT WE COUNTED"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "On the main routes 50 to 100 people pass every ten minutes, and traffic is heavy too. Few people stay. Places to stand and linger score 1.7 of 5."
